{
  "_comment": "复制为 appsettings.Development.json 并填入真实值（Development.json 在 .gitignore，不入库）。仅列必填/常用段，完整结构见 appsettings.json。",
  "AiProvider": {
    "_comment2": "ApiKey 缺失时 Worker 不拒启动，但 AI fallback / ai action / ai phase 路径会失败（确定性填报无需 key）。建议填。",
    "ApiKey": "",
    "ModelId": "deepseek-v3.2",
    "Endpoint": "https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1",
    "ModelApiErrorOptions": {
      "MaxRetryCount": 2,
      "RetryBaseInterval": 1000,
      "CircuitBreakerThreshold": 5
    }
  },
  "WorkerOptions": {
    "_comment5": "协议剥离后单一 HTTP 模式（TaskMode/BaseUrl 已删，WsClient/Platform 段已随 ws 上移 PlatformAdapter）。push/pull 总开关：push=true 且请求体传 progressCallbackUrl/completeCallbackUrl 才 HTTP POST 回调；pull=true 写内存/JSONL 供 GET 查。字段名 PushOptions（非 Push）避免与 bool push 在 ASP.NET Core case-insensitive 配置绑定下冲突。完整 WorkerOptions 段（含 TaskResultStore/Types/Retry）见 appsettings.json。",
    "ProgressReport": { "Enabled": { "Push": false, "Pull": true } },
    "CompleteReport": { "Enabled": { "Push": false, "Pull": true } }
  }
}
